DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45267::$$$message_0413_0000_0000$$$::"You're..."::
45268::$$$message_0413_0000_0001$$$::"Oh?"::
45269::$$$message_0413_0000_0002$$$::"Mama!?"::
45270::$$$message_0413_0000_0003$$$::"Mrgh..."::
45271::$$$message_0413_0000_0004$$$::"Papa!"::
45272::$$$message_0413_0000_0005$$$::"What are you doing here...!? Dad, I thought you were on a business trip overseas."::
45273::$$$message_0413_0000_0006$$$::"Also, you two look kinda young..."::
45274::$$$message_0413_0000_0007$$$::"Are you mistaking us for someone else? I'm sorry, young ladies, but we aren't your parents."::
45275::$$$message_0413_0000_0008$$$::"Did she just disown us!?"::
45276::$$$message_0413_0000_0009$$$::"Your tone isn't the usual silly one! Even if it's a joke, it's really mean, Mama!"::
45277::$$$message_0413_0000_0010$$$::"Like I said, you're mistaken. While I do have a daughter, she's younger than you. My precious baby girl is the cutest in the world."::
45278::$$$message_0413_0000_0011$$$::"Um... Sh-should I be mad, or embarrassed...?"::
45279::$$$message_0413_0000_0012$$$::"Wait, Mama! That's enough!"::
45280::$$$message_0413_0000_0013$$$::"Stop right there. Don't get any closer."::
45281::$$$message_0413_0000_0014$$$::"Wah!?"::
45282::$$$message_0413_0000_0015$$$::"Get back, Illya! This person is...strong!"::
45283::$$$message_0413_0000_0016$$$::"What the heck, Mama!? Don't you recognize us!?"::
45284::$$$message_0413_0000_0017$$$::"Mama, Daddy! It's me, Illya!"::
45285::$$$message_0413_0000_0018$$$::"Illya...? Y-you do resemble her, but you can't be..."::
45286::$$$message_0413_0000_0019$$$::"Don't fall for it, Iri. This is enemy disinformation. That...is not Illya."::
45287::$$$message_0413_0000_0020$$$::"R-right. There's no way she'd be here...[wvl canskip=false time=400][hffgchg2 chara=アイリ face=喜 pos=right time=400 twno=1] Actually, now that I get a good look at her, she doesn't look like Illya at all."::
45288::$$$message_0413_0000_0021$$$::"Hey!"::
45289::$$$message_0413_0000_0022$$$::"It's only a superficial resemblance. But most of all, our daughter would never wear such a scandalous outfit."::
45290::$$$message_0413_0000_0023$$$::"I know her clothes are embarrassing, but that's mean, Papa!"::
45291::$$$message_0413_0000_0024$$$::"We aren't wearing these because we want to!"::
45292::$$$message_0413_0000_0025$$$::(So they do find their outfits embarrassing...)::
45293::$$$message_0413_0000_0026$$$::"I don't know which Master you are, but it's disgraceful of you to pretend to be our children. Show us who you really are!"::
45294::$$$message_0413_0000_0027$$$::"Here they come, Illya!"::
45295::$$$message_0413_0000_0028$$$::"Waaah, is our family about to fall apart!?"::
45296::$$$message_0413_0000_0029$$$::"Fine, if you're going to be that way, then we'll show you our rebellious phase!"::

